  message: "emission-parity:F1 / G2 gate (PR #4202) locks (python, qualified_name) as a strict-xfail hole — confirmed live: Python qualified_name 0/5 on the fixture. Live-dataclass finding that narrows scope: JavaScript DOES populate qualified_name (5/6 live on the same gate), contradicting the F23.6 bash/javascript/solidity-also-0pct expansion — that was a serialized-JSON probe artifact. So the gap is Python-specific (py.py wires qualified_name into the Symbol.name kwarg). Stays todo_hard; the gate XPASS-trips when py.py is fixed."  # 0edf
